    pr_ref:  # f07d
    description: "Setting the same before target on N items requires N separate invocations. Two improvements: (1) Accept multiple positional item IDs: 'tracker update WI-a WI-b WI-c --add-before INV-x' applies the same mutation to all listed items. (2) Add --add-blocked-by as the inverse of --add-before: 'tracker update INV-x --add-blocked-by WI-a WI-b WI-c' means 'WI-a, WI-b, WI-c all block INV-x' — expresses fan-in dependency in one command instead of N. Discovered during PlazaFlow tracker setup where 4 items needed the same before target, requiring 4 separate commands."  # f07d
    fields: {}  # f07d
